        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur DECSWPLTB, Deco Blank Switch Plate Cover</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deco Blank Outlet Cover Plate is the perfect finishing touch for any traditional home. Switch plates are so often overlooked when designing the interior of a home. It's easy to go out and get the cheep plastic ones that discolor and look tacky; but every interior designer knows, it's the finishing details that really bring a room together. This solid brass Blank Deco Switch Plate has a stepped design that makes it a great choice for the retro design aesthetic that is so popular for its classic beauty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grandeur Blank Deco Switch Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
